    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Canonical key</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/group-shifted-strings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 249</a></div>\n  <h1>Group Shifted Strings</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: shift every word back until it starts with 'a' (subtract its first letter from each letter, modulo 26); words of one shifting sequence all land on the same key, so one hash map groups them. O(N &middot; L) time and space.</p>\n"
